{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36563","headline":"西京崇德里居 · 罗隐","name":"西京崇德里居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"进乏梯媒退又难，强随豪贵殢长安。\n风从昨夜吹银汉，泪拟何门落玉盘。\n抛掷红尘应有恨，思量仙桂也无端。\n锦鳞赬尾平生事，却被闲人把钓竿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}